  "description": "Source-only helpers for a mod's game-side test adapter (a BepInEx plugin using ValheimCLI's extension API): registration once the API is ready, the owned-session identity capability the Valheim.Testing.Game runners check, zone and terrain fixture pieces, exact reflection, console aliases, a plugin-installed capability, a reply-field parser, a census of applied Harmony patches, a census of registered items, recipes and prefabs, a flush that keeps quit-time plugin lines in BepInEx's disk log, and observations of global keys, live config entries, unresolved prefab hashes and saved dungeon rooms. Unofficial community tooling; not affiliated with or endorsed by Iron Gate or Coffee Stain. Valheim is a trademark of Iron Gate AB.",
